<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Transfer (245)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>transfer &lt;someone&gt;                 (to you)
transfer &lt;someone&gt; &lt;room@zone&gt;
transfer &lt;someone&gt; &lt;someone else&gt;  (to where they are)
transfer all now                   (every player, to you)
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>transfer Gnort
transfer Gnort temple@udgaard
transfer guard Papi
</pre>
<p>Moves a player or a monster from anywhere in the game: to you, to a room 
by its symbolic name, or to wherever someone or something else is. They 
disappear in a mushroom cloud, appear in a puff of smoke, are told who 
transferred them, and look around. Things can't be transferred, only 
players and monsters.
</p><p>transfer all brings every player in the game to you; you must type 
transfer all now, to be sure. Dead players (still spirits) can only be 
transferred from level 250. It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Goto</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp At</a>
</pre>




</div>